= entry .Install   the error raised when writing something onto the host fails: completion scripts, manpages, a daemon
-   detail
+   detail

-       Installing a completion script (`Completions.install`), a manpage
-       (`Manpages.install`) or a daemon fails the same two ways, so the error belongs to the
-       act rather than to any one installer. `Install.Error` is error `↯/s.109.3`, _the installation
-       failed because `reason`_, with the reason's number as its subcode.
-   entry .Error   error `↯/s.109.3`: the installation failed, because of the environment or an I/O failure
+       Installare uno script di completamento (`Completions.install`), una pagina di manuale
+       (`Manpages.install`) o un demone fallisce negli stessi due modi, quindi l'errore appartiene
+       all'atto invece che a un singolo installatore. `Install.Error` è l'errore `↯/s.109.3`, _the
+       installation failed because `reason`_, con il numero del motivo come suo sottocodice.
+   entry .Error   errore `↯/s.109.3`: l'installazione è fallita, a causa dell'ambiente o di un errore di I/O

=   entry .Error   error `↯/s.109.3`: the installation failed, because of the environment or an I/O failure
-     detail
+     detail

-         Raised through a `Tactic[Install.Error]` by `Completions.install` and
-         `Manpages.install`. `Reason.Environment` (1) means _it was not possible to get enough
-         information about the install environment_ — a path, name or shell query failed;
-         `Reason.Io` (2) means _an I/O error occurred when trying to write an installation
-         file_.
-     entry .Reason   why an installation failed: `Environment` or `Io`
+         Sollevato tramite una `Tactic[Install.Error]` da `Completions.install` e da
+         `Manpages.install`. `Reason.Environment` (1) significa _it was not possible to get enough
+         information about the install environment_ — un path, un nome o un'interrogazione della
+         shell è fallito; `Reason.Io` (2) significa _an I/O error occurred when trying to write an
+         installation file_.
+     entry .Reason   perché un'installazione è fallita: `Environment` o `Io`

=     entry .Reason   why an installation failed: `Environment` or `Io`
-       detail
+       detail

